'''Chambers of Xeric: CM (5-Scale) Speed-Runner''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete a Chambers of Xeric: Challenge Mode (5-scale) in under 25:00.

Like other tasks requiring a specific number of players, this combat achievement is not required for [[Group Ironman Mode|Group Ironmen]] with a smaller group size.

